        IILOPool(initializedPools[i]).launch();
    }

    emit ProjectLaunch(uniV3PoolAddress);
}
```

By incorporating a tolerance range, the contract can accommodate minor price variations and prevent unnecessary reversion of the `launch` function. This enhances the overall user experience and ensures smoother project deployments, maintaining the integrity and reliability of the platform.


