# Vulnerability details

The [TickMath.sol]() library was taken from [v3-core](https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/0.8/contracts/libraries/TickMath.sol). The  solidity version that was used  in  [TickMath.sol](https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/0.8/contracts/libraries/TickMath.sol) library of uniswap is [^0.8.0](https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/6562c52e8f75f0c10f9deaf44861847585fc8129/contracts/libraries/TickMath.sol#L2) and it uses [unchecked block](https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/6562c52e8f75f0c10f9deaf44861847585fc8129/contracts/libraries/TickMath.sol#L27) to handle overflow. 
However, [getQuoteAtTick( )](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/cb72b1e9053c02a58d874ff376359a83dc3f0742/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/OracleLibrary.sol#L36) function  used in the [OracleLibrary.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/main/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/OracleLibrary.sol) contract to get the `sqrtRatioX96` is derived from  the   [TickMath.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/cb72b1e9053c02a58d874ff376359a83dc3f0742/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/TickMath.sol)    which uses  version `>=0.5.0`. 
This  version indicates that the contract is intended to be compatible with Solidity version `0.5.0` and any compatible version greater than or equal to `0.5.0`, but it does not wrap [getSqrtRatioAtTick()](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/cb72b1e9053c02a58d874ff376359a83dc3f0742/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/TickMath.sol#L23) in  the [TickMath.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/cb72b1e9053c02a58d874ff376359a83dc3f0742/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/TickMath.sol)   in an `unchecked block` leading to incorrect returned value or revert   if an overflow is reached 



## Impact

The values returned from [getQuoteAtTick( )](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/cb72b1e9053c02a58d874ff376359a83dc3f0742/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/OracleLibrary.sol#L36) function  as [quoteAmount](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/cb72b1e9053c02a58d874ff376359a83dc3f0742/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/OracleLibrary.sol#L41) wont be correct and the execution of this function may reverted when overflow occurs.


## Proof of Concept
Below is the [OracleLibrary.sol](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/main/hardhat-vultisig/contracts/oracles/uniswap/uniswapv0.8/OracleLibrary.sol) library which specifies a solidity version `>=0.5.0` which indicates that the contract is intended to be compatible with Solidity version `0.5.0` and any compatible version greater than or equal to `0.5.0`. 


