## Proof of Concept
The claim() function directly transfers tokens to the user and does not use push-vs-pull pattern.

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/main/src/ILOPool.sol#L252
```js
    // transfer token for user
    // @audit blocked user will not be able to claim liquidity as the below line will revert, thus fees generated for the protocol from that user will be locked
    TransferHelper.safeTransfer(_cachedPoolKey.token0, ownerOf(tokenId), amount0);
    TransferHelper.safeTransfer(_cachedPoolKey.token1, ownerOf(tokenId), amount1);

    emit Claim(ownerOf(tokenId), tokenId,liquidity2Claim, amount0, amount1, position.feeGrowthInside0LastX128, position.feeGrowthInside1LastX128);

