    TransferHelper.safeTransfer(_cachedPoolKey.token1, feeTaker, amountCollected1-amount1);
```

As a result if either ownerOf(tokenId) or feeTaker are blacklisted, the claim function will start reverting, either only for the blacklisted user or if the fee taker is blacklisted for all users calling the function. 

If that happens, the blacklisted user will have to transfer ownership of the token to claim his/her funds, or users will have to wait for the fee taker address to be changed or removed from the token blacklist. 

