## Impact

Fees calculated incorrectly.

## Proof of Concept

When investors claims their liquidity, `pool.burn` will be called and then `pool.positions`. When `pool.burn` is called, it will reduce the liquidity in the current position of `address(this)`. Then, when pool.positions is called, it will use the decreased position of the liquidity instead of the original position, which means that lesser fees will be calculated.

```
